## ObjectType: Demand Forecast

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| forecast_id | Forecast id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | forecast_id |
| product_id | Product id | string | Foreign key to products; blank creates no edge. | product_id |
| location_id | Location id | string | Foreign key to locations; blank creates no edge. | location_id |
| demand_date | Demand date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | demand_date |
| quantity | Quantity | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | quantity |
| unit | Unit | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: ea. | unit |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | known_date |
| view_kind | View kind | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: Planned. | view_kind |
| view_code | View code | string | Stable machine code; localized display value is separate. Allowed values: planned. | view_code |

